  <AltText>
    Very cute Artfight attack of Kiko Fujisakita from RemiPoto. Kiko is a fox with pink fur, with light blue overcoat on the arms. She has two small horns, and large fox ears. They also have light blue hair flowing down to waist length. There is a heart-shaped ahoge at the top of its hair. Soft is wearing a dark blue hair ribbon, a dark green dress with a yellow belt, and purple socks. The belt is adorned with five buttons. These buttons are, from left to right: the transgender flag, the softgender flag, a large button with a pawprint on it, the demiromantic flag, and the asexual flag.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    Very cute and colorful character!
